## VM flags of the ratsprojekte release (#440, ADR 0004 „Betrieb“).

## Schedulers sleep at once instead of busy-waiting, including the dirty
## CPU and IO schedulers: the idle hub should cost (almost) no CPU.
+sbwt none
+sbwtdcpu none
+sbwtdio none

## Enable deployment without epmd (no distribution, see env.sh.eex)
-start_epmd false
